                <mxCell id="B1" value="Automation System: create one request → Eligibility Gate (lock period &amp; paperwork) → validate times vs hours / lead time.&#10;➜ Ineligible/paperwork: Intoxalock Representative handles it (tracked, with reminders)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
